<div class="app-layout">
  <%= render "trainers/sidebar" %>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="onboarding-container">
      <header class="page-header-authenticated">
        <h1>Congratulations, <%= @trainer.username %>!</h1>
        <p>You've chosen <%= @pokemon.name.capitalize %> as your partner!</p>
      </header>

      <div class="professor-oak-section">
        <div class="sendoff-sprites">
          <%= image_tag "trainerSprites/gymLeaders/oak.png", class: "professor-oak" %>
          <%= image_tag "pokemonSprites/#{@pokemon.pokedex_number.to_s.rjust(3, '0')}.png",
              alt: @pokemon.name,
              class: "sendoff-starter-sprite",
              style: "image-rendering: pixelated;" %>
        </div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
          <p>Excellent choice, <%= @trainer.username %>!</p>
          <p>You and <%= @pokemon.name.capitalize %> will make a fine team!</p>

          <div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF4E6 0%, #FFE8CC 100%); border-left: 4px solid #F4A460; border-radius: 8px;">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: #6B5537;">
              "Just as a well-architected codebase stands the test of time, a trainer who follows good practices will achieve greatness. Write clean code, test thoroughly, and remember: premature optimization is the root of all evil, but thoughtful design is the foundation of success."
            </p>
          </div>

          <p>To get you started on your journey, here's a Pokéball and some extra money to help you along the way!</p>

          <ul>
            <li>🎁 <strong>1 Pokéball</strong> - Use it wisely to catch your next Pokémon!</li>
            <li>💰 <strong>100 Pokédollars</strong> - Stock up on items at the shop!</li>
          </ul>

          <p>Now get out there and show the world what you and <%= @pokemon.name.capitalize %> can do!</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%= form_with url: onboarding_complete_path, method: :post do |f| %>
        <%= f.submit "Begin Your Journey!", class: "btn-primary btn-large" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
